        "Track B: exact Gaussian elimination over GF(2) solves the encoded system "
        "in O(V^3); at the shipping preset V=192 the scalar reference baseline "
        "uses about 100,000 exact bit operations and 0.04 seconds (measured in "
        "selftest), whereas the cyclic inverse plus circuit reversal uses 224 XORs."
    ),
    "max_answer_tokens": 24,
}


NATIVE = {
