codex
Implemented a Track B generator based on the paper’s Section 3, Lemma 4 line-graph construction. The family inverse-generates XOR-structured 3-SAT assignments and carries them to certified 2-Disjoint Connected Subgraphs witnesses in claw-free line graphs. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.06349)

Local verification passes G1–G9(c):

- 0/200,000 random guesses succeeded.
- Five attacks each scored 0/8.
- Gaussian reference solver succeeded 8/8, honestly reported for Track B.
- Answer: 32 atoms, 96 JSON characters.
- Compact route: 224 XOR operations.
- Canonicalization: 60/60 invariance checks and 20/20 distinct instances.

