The stronger local audit passes: 300/300 canonical-key invariance checks, 300/300 carried witnesses, and 20/20 unrelated keys distinct. The shipping answer is 96 characters/32 atoms, the compact route is 224 XORs, and all five no-tool attacks remain 0/8; Gaussian elimination succeeds 8/8 as the disclosed Track B reference. The only unresolved requirement is external: `harden.py` received HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded” on every redraw.
All local implementation and gate work is complete. The mandated OpenRouter hardening call was attempted and aborted after four HTTP 403 quota errors, so no valid oracle verdict can be produced until the key limit is raised.
